OL,3,AOrange Order submits new 'limited'
OL,4,ADrumcree parade plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe submission comes after a court case
OL,7,Fsaw the Parades Commission's most
OL,8,Frecent determination on Drumcree
OL,9,Foverturned.
OL,11,FAt a press conference, the Orange Order
OL,12,Fsaid members of the Parades Commission
OL,13,Fhad "no credibility" to adjudicate on
OL,14,Ftheir application and should resign.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
